  allLines:
  - side: 0
    characterName: Loreen
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 821994f203fef8344a71dda283821891, type: 3}
    sentence: I apologize if I overstepped. Just trying to approach this with caution,
      you know?
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dc24e77c8220d5b43bd418e911809b3b, type: 3}
    sentence: "Yeah, no that\u2019s fair. It is a crazy concept after all. You know
      nothing about me.\r\n"
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Loreen
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Except the fact that you are most likely not a serial killer.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "Maybe I\u2019m so good at covering up my crimes that I was able to
      infiltrate a government-funded service to meet as many women as I want.\r\n"
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 3
    characterName: Chaperon
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "Well, it\u2019s just the one."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 2
    characterName: Counselor
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: The way he said that made it even more suspicious, somehow. Do you
      want me to press the button?
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 3
    characterName: Chaperon
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Uhh, what button?
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 2
    characterName: Counselor
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: THE button, silly.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 3
    characterName: Chaperon
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Uhh, nnoo..?
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 2
    characterName: Counselor
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: 'Wow, I definitely trust that decision with the way you sounded so
      confident and all.

'
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Loreen
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Hey, Chaperon. Is this a game or something? On the tablet?
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 3
    characterName: Chaperon
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Ah yes, sorry. The tablet in front of you displays the Icebreaker.
      Are you familiar with the title?
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Yep.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 3
    characterName: Chaperon
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Uh-huh.
    eventTrigger: 
